;
; coding information
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
C00,Brake Electronics (J104/Bosch 8.0) Coding
C01,If the old Control Module is still accessible read/copy it's Coding
C02,to the new Module. In case this is not possible please contact us
C03,directly and we will assist you with the Coding Process.
C04, 
C05,http://www.ross-tech.com/contact.html
C06, 
C07,Once you've successfully coded the Control Module you have to align
C08,the Steering Angle Sensor (G85). Further instructions can be found in
C09,our Ross-Tech WIKI (http://WIKI.Ross-Tech.com).
